  "title": "CNH Industrial N.V. Reports Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025 Results",
  "summary": "Fourth quarter consolidated revenues increased 6%; full year revenues declined 9% on lower industry equipment demand Fourth quarter net income of $89 million; full year net income of $505 million Full year diluted EPS at $0.41; adjusted diluted EPS at $0.55 Amid persistent agricultural equipment market challenges, the Company is preparing for lower demand levels in 2026 ahead of the start of an expected industry recovery in 2027 Basildon, UK - February 17, 2026 - CNH Industrial N.V. (NYSE: CNH)",
